    "prompt": "One continuous detailed hand-drawn anime observation after the pictured embrace, with contact already established. Preserve both adult faces, her green-hazel eyes, freckles and auburn hair, his light beard and moustache, clothes and pendants. He stays frightened and attentive beside her while they take small, naturally uneven breaths; his worried eyelids change briefly and she gives one tired blink while looking down and away. His arm remains behind her and his visible hand keeps the same outer-upper-arm shoulder grip throughout, with coherent fingers and rings. Her own hands remain passive in her lap; her head is supported by her own neck, not resting on his chest. Keep both bodies supported by the chairs. No new pull, squeeze, hug, hand lift, stroke, head pat or repeated action. No smile, speech or reassurance. Locked camera, stable room and lighting; continuous restrained breathing, not a static hold.",
